    498  f8f8							; hot shape's hot cells ARE its solid row-1 PF cells; the C4 bomb punch
    499  f8f8							; clears PF0Buf cells, so a blasted (thin) parent cell stops being hot with
    500  f8f8							; no record stream and no parent gate. Hot cells never exist on rows 0/2.
