    921  fb2e							; ==============================================================================
    922  fb2e							; PhVcApplyOR / PhVcApplyAND DELETED (2026-10-19) — same retired vcrunch
    923  fb2e							; tramp path. PhHcrEntry now stores the prefix mask directly (fixed 10).
    924  fb2e							; ==============================================================================
    925  fb2e							; ==============================================================================
    926  fb2e							; HcrClock — hcrunch animation clock (fixed full=10 since 2026-10-19).
    927  fb2e							;   In:  X = full extent (cells, ≥1); reads EnemyRamP (StartFrame-pinned)
    928  fb2e							;   Out: A = covered (1..full) — never 0 (always-solid stub)
    929  fb2e							;   Clobbers A (X/Y preserved — unlike CrunchClock). No latch: the kill
    930  fb2e							;   repeats on contact (DropArm respawns at the room top, so no loop).
    931  fb2e							; s = EnemyRamP>>4 (0..15, one 256f period = 16 buckets of 16f):
    932  fb2e							;   s 0-3   dwell at home  (eff 0)	  -> n=1, 64f stub
    933  fb2e							;   s 4-12  grow to center  (eff s-3)	  -> n 2..full (1..9 cells of
    934  fb2e							;	    8px — full=w>>1; w=20 record = center of the screen)
    935  fb2e							;   s 13-15 fast retract    (eff 3*(15-s) = 6,3,0) — wipe home in 3
    936  fb2e							;	    steps (the old instant far-end turn, stretched to center)
    937  fb2e							; covered = 1 + min(eff, full-1). CrunchClock (sc>>2 triangle, ~4f/step)
    938  fb2e							; stays for its VCR mirrors + verify_build token gate — only the two
    939  fb2e							; hcrunch call sites moved here (16f/step, grow-to-center ruling
    940  fb2e							; 2026-10-16). Both callers pass full=10 (PhHcrEntry stages it, HOV
    941  fb2e							; tests it); the latch freeze was removed with the 2026-10-19 contract.
    942  fb2e							; ==============================================================================
    943  fb2e				   HcrClock
    944  fb2e		       e0 01		      cpx	#1
    945  fb30		       d0 03		      bne	.hcN
    946  fb32		       a9 01		      lda	#1	; full=1: n always 1
    947  fb34		       60		      rts
    948  fb35				   .hcN
    949  fb35		       a5 c2		      lda	EnemyRamP
    950  fb37		       4a		      lsr
    951  fb38		       4a		      lsr
    952  fb39		       4a		      lsr
    953  fb3a		       4a		      lsr		; s = P>>4
    954  fb3b		       c9 04		      cmp	#4
    955  fb3d		       b0 04		      bcs	.hcNd
    956  fb3f		       a9 00		      lda	#0	; s0-3 dwell: eff 0
    957  fb41		       f0 11		      beq	.hcOut	; (always)
    958  fb43				   .hcNd
    959  fb43		       c9 0d		      cmp	#13
    960  fb45		       b0 05		      bcs	.hcNf
    961  fb47		       38		      sec
    962  fb48		       e9 03		      sbc	#3	; s4-12: eff = s-3 (1..9) — grow to center
    963  fb4a		       b0 08		      bcs	.hcOut	; (always, no borrow)
    964  fb4c				   .hcNf
    965  fb4c		       49 0f		      eor	#$0F	; s13-15: t = 15-s (2,1,0) — fast retract
    966  fb4e		       85 8b		      sta	CollisionX
    967  fb50		       0a		      asl
    968  fb51		       18		      clc
    969  fb52		       65 8b		      adc	CollisionX	; eff = 3t (6,3,0)
    970  fb54				   .hcOut
    971  fb54		       18		      clc
    972  fb55		       69 01		      adc	#1	; candidate = eff+1
    973  fb57		       85 8b		      sta	CollisionX	; scratch (HOV owns Temp; VBL path owns no consumer)
    974  fb59		       8a		      txa		; full
    975  fb5a		       c5 8b		      cmp	CollisionX
    976  fb5c		       b0 01		      bcs	.hcR
    977  fb5e		       60		      rts		; full < candidate -> A = full already
