   1127  fd2c		       85 88		      sta	Temp
   1128  fd2e							; --- No ball in this room → BE the ball gate off. ---------------------
   1129  fd2e							; BandTab is the per-band ENABL gate for the cave (.Row). MetaA bit0 is
   1130  fd2e							; the band-0 gate AND (for a door) the "M1 strip on the RIGHT half"
   1131  fd2e							; flag — a door has no ball, so its bit0 must NOT enable one. Before
   1132  fd2e							; this, the door room rendered a wall-coloured (COLUPF) ball bar over
   1133  fd2e							; the band-0 opening: ENABL on, RESPBL never strobed (Temp=0) → the
   1134  fd2e							; ball free-ran at x72-79 (user screenshot 2026-10-17, door_right.png).
