   1153  fd3a							; CollisionCellX/CollisionEndY ($8F scratch — the pack below rebuilds
   1154  fd3a							; it). The PF buffers ARE the collision map (cell walk + laser read
   1155  fd3a							; them) — toggling the cell's two bits THERE makes render + PHM +
   1156  fd3a							; laser follow with zero kernel cost. 64f full cycle = EnemyRamP bit5
   1157  fd3a							; (32 on + 32 off; clock-derived, no state bytes — locked plan).
